"cle";"famille";"motif";"titre";"action";"commentaire"
"java";"";"^Oracle Java";"Update Oracle Java SE";"Install the latest available Oracle Java SE update on every JRE/JDK present, then uninstall the obsolete versions detected on the machine.";"All Java vulnerabilities are fixed by the latest update."
"log4j";"";"Apache Log4j|Log4Shell";"Remove Log4j 1.x and update Log4j 2";"Remove the Log4j 1.x libraries (end of support) by migrating applications to Log4j 2, and bring Log4j 2 up to the latest patch release. Work with vendors to identify the applications that bundle the affected JAR files.";""
"esxi";"";"^VMware ESXi";"Update the VMware ESXi hypervisor";"Apply the latest ESXi patch for the installed branch, which includes the fixes for advisories {avis}. Place the host in maintenance mode and migrate the VMs before the operation.";""
"vcenter";"";"^VMware vCenter";"Update VMware vCenter Server";"Update vCenter Server to the fixed version listed in advisories {avis}.";""
"defender";"";"Windows Defender|Microsoft Defender|Malware Protection Engine";"Update Microsoft Defender";"Update the Defender anti-malware platform, engine and signatures; check that automatic updates are enabled.";""
"linux-unpatched";"";"^Linux Distros Unpatched Vulnerability : (?P<cve>CVE-[\d-]+)";"Track Linux vulnerabilities with no published patch";"The distribution has not yet published a patch for {cves}. Follow the vendor's advisories, apply the published mitigations and install the patch as soon as it becomes available.";""
"kb:{kb}";"";"^(?P<kb>KB\d+)\s*:\s*(?P<os>.+?)\s+(?:Security|Cumulative|Servicing Stack)";"Install Windows update {kb}";"Install update {kb} ({os}) or a more recent cumulative update, then restart. It supersedes earlier cumulative updates.";""
"kb:{kb}";"";"^(?P<kb>KB\d+)\b";"Install Windows update {kb}";"Install update {kb} or a more recent cumulative update, then restart.";""
"ms:{ms}";"";"^(?P<ms>MS\d\d-\d{3})\b";"Apply Microsoft patch {ms}";"Install the patch from bulletin {ms} (or a more recent cumulative update that includes it).";""
"wincfg";"";"WinVerifyTrust|EnableCertPaddingCheck";"Harden the Windows configuration (registry and policies)";"Create the value EnableCertPaddingCheck = 1 under HKLM\Software\Microsoft\Cryptography\Wintrust\Config (and Wow6432Node).";""
"wincfg";"";"Speculative Execution";"Harden the Windows configuration (registry and policies)";"Enable the speculative execution mitigations (values FeatureSettingsOverride / FeatureSettingsOverrideMask under HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Session Manager\Memory Management).";""
"wincfg";"";"CredSSP";"Harden the Windows configuration (registry and policies)";"Set the “Encryption Oracle Remediation” policy to Force Updated Clients.";""
"wincfg";"";"CVE-2017-8529";"Harden the Windows configuration (registry and policies)";"Add the key FEATURE_ENABLE_PRINT_INFO_DISCLOSURE_FIX (iexplore.exe = 1) recommended by Microsoft.";""
"wincfg";"";"Unquoted Service Path";"Harden the Windows configuration (registry and policies)";"Enclose in quotation marks the executable paths of services that contain spaces.";""
"wincfg";"";"Insecure Windows Service Permissions|Service Permissions";"Harden the Windows configuration (registry and policies)";"Remove write permissions for non-administrator users on service executables and configuration.";""
"wincfg";"";"WDigest";"Harden the Windows configuration (registry and policies)";"Disable WDigest (UseLogonCredential = 0) so that clear-text passwords are no longer kept in memory.";""
"wincfg";"";"AutoRun|AutoPlay|Autorun";"Harden the Windows configuration (registry and policies)";"Disable AutoRun / AutoPlay by group policy.";""
"wincfg";"";"LM Hash|NTLMv1|LAN Manager";"Harden the Windows configuration (registry and policies)";"Prohibit LM and NTLMv1 (LAN Manager authentication level: NTLMv2 only, refuse LM and NTLM).";""
"smb";"";"SMB Signing not required|SMB Signing Disabled|Signing not required";"Require SMB signing";"Enable “Microsoft network server/client: Digitally sign communications (always)” by group policy.";""
"smb1";"";"SMBv1|SMB Protocol Version 1|Server Message Block \(SMB\) Protocol Version 1";"Disable SMBv1";"Disable the SMBv1 protocol (Windows feature “SMB 1.0/CIFS”) on servers and workstations.";""
"smbnull";"";"NULL Session|Null Session|Anonymous.*(Share|Enumeration)";"Prohibit anonymous SMB sessions";"Restrict anonymous access (RestrictAnonymous, “Network access: Do not allow anonymous enumeration”).";""
"llmnr";"";"LLMNR|NetBIOS Name Service|NBT-NS";"Disable LLMNR and NetBIOS";"Disable LLMNR and NetBIOS over TCP/IP by group policy to prevent name resolution poisoning.";""
"rdp";"";"Terminal Services|Network Level Authentication|Remote Desktop Protocol Server";"Harden RDP access";"Require Network Level Authentication (NLA), a high encryption level and an RDP certificate issued by a trusted authority; restrict RDP access to administration workstations.";""
"ldap";"";"LDAP.*(Signing|Channel Binding)|Unencrypted LDAP|LDAP NULL BIND";"Secure LDAP";"Require LDAP signing and channel binding, and prefer LDAPS.";""
"os:rhel";"";"^RHEL \d+ : (?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for Red Hat Enterprise Linux";"Run “dnf update --security” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:centos";"";"^CentOS \d+ : (?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for CentOS";"Run “yum update --security” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:oraclelinux";"";"^Oracle Linux \d+ : (?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for Oracle Linux";"Run “dnf update --security (yum on Oracle Linux 7)” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:almalinux";"";"^Alma ?Linux \d+ : (?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for AlmaLinux";"Run “dnf update --security” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:rocky";"";"^Rocky Linux \d+ : (?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for Rocky Linux";"Run “dnf update --security” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:fedora";"";"^Fedora \d+ : (?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for Fedora";"Run “dnf upgrade --refresh” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:amazonlinux";"";"^Amazon Linux[^:]* : (?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for Amazon Linux";"Run “dnf update --security (yum on Amazon Linux 2)” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:debian";"";"^Debian (?:[dD][sSlL][aA]-[\d-]+|\d+)\s*:\s*(?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for Debian";"Run “apt update && apt upgrade” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:ubuntu";"";"^Ubuntu [^:]+ : (?P<paquet>.+?)\s+(?:vulnerabilit|regression|update)";"Apply security patches for Ubuntu";"Run “apt update && apt upgrade” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:suse";"";"^(?:SUSE|openSUSE)[^:]*:\s*(?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for SUSE / openSUSE";"Run “zypper patch --category security” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:euleros";"";"^EulerOS[^:]* : (?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for EulerOS";"Run “yum update” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:unity";"";"^Unity Linux[^:]*:\s*(?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for Unity Linux";"Run “dnf update” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:photon";"";"^Photon OS[^:]*:\s*(?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for Photon OS";"Run “tdnf update” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:azurelinux";"";"^(?:Azure Linux|CBL-Mariner)[^:]*:\s*(?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for Azure Linux";"Run “tdnf update” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:alibaba";"";"^Alibaba Cloud Linux[^:]*:\s*(?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for Alibaba Cloud Linux";"Run “dnf update --security” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:freebsd";"";"^FreeBSD : (?P<paquet>[^\s(]+)";"Apply security patches for FreeBSD";"Run “pkg upgrade” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:gentoo";"";"^GLSA-[\d-]+ : (?P<paquet>[^:]+)";"Apply security patches for Gentoo";"Run “emerge --sync && emerge -uDN @world” or update the affected packages: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";""
"os:{famille}";"Local Security Checks$";":\s*(?P<paquet>[A-Za-z0-9][\w.+\-]*)";"Apply security patches for {famille}";"Update the affected packages with the system's package manager: {paquets}.{redemarrage}";"All “Local Security Checks” families not covered above."
"os:{famille}";"Local Security Checks$";".";"Apply security patches for {famille}";"Apply the security updates published by the operating system vendor.";""
"cisco:{produit}";"";"^Cisco (?P<produit>.+?) Software\b";"Update Cisco {produit}";"Install a fixed version{precision} listed in Cisco advisories {avis}.";""
"cisco:{produit}";"";"^Cisco (?P<produit>.+?)(?: (?:Security Hardening|Multiple|API|Authentication|Unauthorized|Command|Python|Control Plane|Endpoint|RCE|DoS|Denial|Privilege|Cross|SQL|Information|Arbitrary|Remote|Stored|Reflected|Path|Directory|Buffer|Improper|Missing|Insufficient|Vulnerabilit|UEFI|sftunnel|TLS)\b.*)?\s*\(cisco-sa-";"Update Cisco {produit}";"Install a fixed version{precision} listed in Cisco advisories {avis}.";""
"fortinet:{produit}";"";"^Fortinet (?P<produit>Forti\w+).*?(?:\((?P<avis>FG-IR-[\d-]+)\))?$";"Update Fortinet {produit}";"Install the fixed version{precision} listed in Fortinet advisories {avis}.";""
"paloalto";"";"^Palo Alto Networks (?P<produit>PAN-OS|GlobalProtect|[\w-]+)";"Update Palo Alto Networks {produit}";"Install the fixed version of {produit} listed in the Palo Alto Networks security advisory.";""
"juniper";"";"^Juniper Junos OS.*?(?:\((?P<avis>JSA\d+)\))?$";"Update Juniper Junos OS";"Install the fixed version of Junos OS{precision} listed in advisories {avis}.";""
"f5";"";"^F5 Networks (?P<produit>BIG-IP[^(]*?)\s.*?(?:\((?P<avis>K\d+)\))?$";"Update F5 {produit}";"Install the fixed version{precision} listed in F5 articles {avis}.";""
"checkpoint:{produit}";"";"^Check Point (?P<produit>.+?)\s*\((?P<avis>sk\d+)\)";"Update Check Point {produit}";"Install the Jumbo Hotfix Accumulator or the fixed version listed in Check Point articles {avis}.";""
"citrix:{produit}";"";"^(?:Citrix )?(?P<produit>(?:NetScaler|Citrix)[^(]*?)(?: (?:DoS|Denial|Multiple|Vulnerabilit|Memory|Information|Improper|Insufficient|RCE|Remote|Session|Authentication|Privilege|Cross|Arbitrary)\b[^(]*)?\s*\((?P<avis>CTX\d+)\)";"Update {produit}";"Install the fixed version{precision} listed in Citrix bulletins {avis}.";""
"os:aix";"";"^AIX\b.*\((?P<avis>IJ\d+)\)";"Apply security patches for AIX";"Install the fixes (APAR / iFix) {avis} or the Technology Level / Service Pack that includes them.";""
"os:rhcos";"";"^RHCOS \d+ : (?P<paquet>.+?)\s*\(";"Update Red Hat CoreOS / OpenShift";"Update the OpenShift cluster to the maintenance release that includes the Red Hat errata; CoreOS nodes are updated by the cluster.";""
"ics:{produit}";"";"^(?P<produit>(?:Siemens|Schneider Electric|Rockwell(?: Automation)?|Delta Electronics|COPA-DATA|ABB|Honeywell|Mitsubishi Electric|Moxa|Phoenix Contact|WAGO|Yokogawa|GE Vernova|Emerson|Omron)\s[^(<]+?)(?:\s+(?:<=?\s*\S+|\d[\w.]*\s*<).*?)?(?:\s+(?:Multiple|Missing|Hard-coded|Path|Improper|Incorrect|Unquoted|Stack|Heap|Out-of-bounds|SQLi|SQL|Information|Authentication|Privilege|Denial|DoS|RCE|Remote|Buffer|Cross|Use)\b.*)?$";"Fix {produit} (industrial system)";"Apply the patch or fixed version{precision} published by the vendor{ref_avis}. On industrial systems, schedule the work with the operator and, in the meantime, isolate the equipment in a dedicated network segment and filter access.";"Industrial equipment and software (SCADA families): work scheduled with the operator."
"certs";"";"SSL Certificate|SSL Self-Signed|X\.509 Certificate|Certificate Expiry|Certificate Chain";"Replace non-compliant TLS certificates";"Replace self-signed, expired, weak or untrusted certificates with certificates issued by a trusted authority, with a name matching the service and an RSA key of at least 2048 bits.";""
"tls";"";"SSL Version 2 and 3|SSLv3|POODLE|TLS Version 1\.[01]|Deprecated Protocol";"Harden the TLS configuration";"Disable SSL 2.0/3.0, TLS 1.0 and TLS 1.1; allow only TLS 1.2 and 1.3.";""
"tls";"";"SWEET32|\bRC4\b|Medium Strength|Weak Cipher|Null Cipher|Anonymous Cipher|EXPORT_RSA|EXPORT Cipher|SSL/TLS EXPORT|FREAK|BEAST|Cipher Block Chaining|Perfect Forward Secrecy";"Harden the TLS configuration";"Remove weak cipher suites (RC4, 3DES, NULL, EXPORT, anonymous) and prefer ECDHE suites with AES-GCM or ChaCha20.";""
"tls";"";"Logjam|SSL/TLS Diffie-Hellman|Diffie-Hellman Modulus|Diffie-Hellman .*Weak";"Harden the TLS configuration";"Use Diffie-Hellman groups of at least 2048 bits, or ECDHE.";""
"tls";"";"Post-Quantum|Harvest Now";"Harden the TLS configuration";"Plan to enable hybrid post-quantum key exchange (ML-KEM) as soon as the products concerned support it.";""
"web";"";"HSTS|Strict Transport Security";"Harden web server configuration";"Add the HTTP Strict-Transport-Security header on HTTPS services.";""
"web";"";"Clickjacking|X-Frame-Options|Content Security Policy|\bCSP\b";"Harden web server configuration";"Add the Content-Security-Policy (frame-ancestors) or X-Frame-Options headers.";""
"web";"";"Cookie.*(Secure|HttpOnly|SameSite)";"Harden web server configuration";"Set the Secure, HttpOnly and SameSite attributes on session cookies.";""
"web";"";"HTTP TRACE|TRACK Method";"Harden web server configuration";"Disable the HTTP TRACE and TRACK methods.";""
"web";"";"Browsable Web Directories|Directory Listing|Directory Indexing";"Harden web server configuration";"Disable directory listing.";""
"web";"";"phpinfo|Apache Server (?:Status|Info)|server-status|Backup Files? Disclosure";"Harden web server configuration";"Remove diagnostic pages and backup files that are accessible from the web.";""
"ssh";"";"SSH Weak|SSH Server CBC|SSH .*Algorithms|SSH Terrapin|SSH Protocol Version 1|SSH .*MAC";"Harden the SSH configuration";"Remove weak algorithms from sshd_config (CBC ciphers, SHA-1/MD5 MACs, diffie-hellman-group1/14-sha1 key exchanges) and apply the fix for Terrapin (disable ChaCha20-Poly1305 and EtM modes if no update is available).";""
"telnet";"";"Telnet Server|Telnet Service";"Disable Telnet";"Disable the Telnet service (passwords are sent in clear text) and administer devices over SSH.";""
"sshkey";"";"SSH Static Key|SSH Default Key|SSH Known Bad Key|Weak SSH Host Key";"Replace weak or default SSH keys";"Regenerate the SSH host keys and remove static or published keys from authorized_keys files.";""
"ftp";"";"Anonymous FTP|FTP .*Cleartext|FTP Supports Cleartext";"Secure or remove FTP";"Disable anonymous FTP access and replace FTP with SFTP or FTPS.";""
"rservices";"";"rlogin|rsh Service|rexec";"Disable the r* services (rlogin, rsh, rexec)";"Disable rlogin, rsh and rexec and use SSH.";""
"snmp";"";"SNMP Agent Default Community|SNMP .*Community|SNMP Protocol Version 1|SNMP Request .*Disclosure";"Secure SNMP";"Replace default or easily guessed SNMP community strings, restrict SNMP access to monitoring stations and switch to SNMPv3.";""
"dns";"";"DNS Server (Cache Snooping|Recursive|Spoofed|Zone Transfer)|AXFR";"Restrict the DNS server";"Limit recursion to authorised internal clients and prohibit unauthorised zone transfers.";""
"ntp";"";"\bNTP\b.*(?:Mode [67]|monlist|Amplification|Denial)|Network Time Protocol \(NTP\) Mode";"Restrict the NTP service";"Disable NTP control queries (mode 6/7) from outside (restrict default noquery).";""
"ipmi";"";"IPMI";"Secure IPMI / BMC interfaces";"Isolate IPMI interfaces on a dedicated administration network, disable cipher 0 and change the default accounts.";""
"vnc";"";"VNC Server (?:Unauthenticated|'password'|Unencrypted|Security Type)";"Secure or disable VNC";"Protect VNC with a strong password and an encrypted tunnel, or disable the service.";""
"x11";"";"X11 Server";"Restrict X11 access";"Prohibit unauthenticated X11 connections (xhost -) or disable network listening on the X server.";""
"nfs";"";"NFS (?:Exported Share|Shares World Readable|Share User Mountable)";"Restrict NFS shares";"Limit NFS exports to authorised hosts and remove world-readable shares.";""
"dbauth";"";"(Redis|MongoDB|Elasticsearch|Memcached|CouchDB|Cassandra).*(Unauthenticated|without Authentication|No Authentication|Unprotected)";"Enable authentication on exposed databases";"Enable authentication and restrict network access to the databases concerned to the application servers only.";""
"defaultcreds";"";"Default Credentials|Default Password|Default Account|Blank Password|Unpassworded";"Change default passwords";"Immediately change the default or blank passwords of the accounts detected.";""
"smtp";"";"Open Relay|SMTP.*(Cleartext|STARTTLS)";"Secure the SMTP server";"Refuse open relay and enforce STARTTLS.";""
"icmp";"";"ICMP Timestamp";"Block ICMP timestamp requests";"Filter ICMP timestamp messages (types 13 and 14) on the local or network firewall.";""
"mdns";"";"mDNS";"Restrict mDNS";"Block mDNS (UDP 5353) outside the local segment or disable the service if it is not needed.";""
"upnp";"";"UPnP (?:Internet|Exposed|Service|Detection)|SSDP";"Restrict UPnP / SSDP";"Disable UPnP or block SSDP (UDP 1900) outside the local segment.";""
"ipfwd";"";"IP Forwarding";"Disable IP routing";"Disable IP forwarding (net.ipv4.ip_forward = 0) if the machine does not act as a router.";""
"dhcp";"";"DHCP Server Detection";"Check the DHCP server";"Check that this DHCP server is legitimate and authorised on this segment; otherwise, disable it.";""
"eol:{produit}";"";"^(?P<produit>.+?)\s+(?:SEoL|Unsupported Version Detection|Unsupported Version|End of Life|EOL)\b";"Replace {produit}, which is no longer maintained";"Migrate {produit} to a version maintained by the vendor: no further security updates will be published for the installed version.";""
"eol-generique";"";"^Unsupported (?:Windows OS|Web Server|Operating System|Installation)\b";"Move to a supported version";"Move to a version currently supported by the vendor: the installed version no longer receives security patches.";"Solution Tenable : Upgrade to a version that is currently supported."
"eol:{produit}";"";"^(?P<produit>.+?)\s+(?:Unsupported\b|No Longer Supported|Not Supported|Is Not Supported)";"Move to a supported version of {produit}";"Move to a version of {produit} currently supported by the vendor: the installed version no longer receives security patches.";"Solution Tenable : Upgrade to a version that is currently supported."
"oraclecpu:{produit}";"";"^(?P<produit>[^<(]+?)(?:\s+[\d.x]+\s*<\s*[\w.]+)?\s+(?:(?:Multiple )?Vulnerabilit\w+\s+)?\((?:\w+ )?(?P<mois>[A-Za-z]+ ?\d{4}) C(?:S)?PU\)";"Apply the latest Oracle Critical Patch Update for {produit}";"Apply the most recent Oracle Critical Patch Update ({mois} or later) for {produit}{precision}.{branches}";""
"maj:{produit}";"";"^(?P<produit>.+?)\s*(?:<=?|\bprior to\b|\bbefore\b)\s*(?:Build\s+|V)?\d";"Update {produit}";"Install {produit} {cible}{ref_avis}.{branches}";"Generic rule: extracts the product and the fixed version from the title “Product < version”."
"sap:{produit}";"";"^SAP (?P<produit>NetWeaver(?: AS (?:Java|ABAP))?|[A-Z][\w]+(?: [A-Z][\w]+)?)\b.*\((?P<note>\d{6,8})\)$";"Apply SAP security notes ({produit})";"Apply SAP security notes {notes} using SAP Note Assistant (SNOTE) or the corresponding support package.";""
"ibm:{produit}";"";"^IBM (?P<produit>.+?)(?:\s+[\d.x/]+(?=\s|$)|\s+(?:Remote|Multiple|Web Server|RCE|XSS|Denial|DoS|Information|Privilege|Security|Cross|SQL|Vulnerab|Improper|Missing|Arbitrary|Path|Directory|Buffer|Authentication|Code)\b).*?\((?P<bulletin>\d{6,8})[,)]";"Apply IBM {produit} fixes";"Apply the fixes described in IBM bulletins {bulletins}.";""
"maj:{produit}";"";"^(?P<produit>.+?)\s+\d[\w.]*\s+-\s+\d[\w.]*\s";"Update {produit}";"Install {produit} {cible}.";"Titles “Product X - Y”: range of vulnerable versions."
"maj:{produit}";"";"^(?:Security Updates? for )?(?P<produit>.+?)\s+\((?P<mois>(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December) \d{4})[^)]*\)";"Update {produit}";"Apply the {produit} security updates published in {mois} or later.";""
"maj:{produit}";"";"^Security Updates? for (?P<produit>.+?)$";"Update {produit}";"Apply the latest {produit} security updates.";""
"maj:{produit}";"";"^(?P<produit>\w[^(]*?)\s+(?:Multiple Vulnerabilities|Vulnerabilit(?:y|ies)|Remote Code Execution|RCE|Denial of Service|DoS|Privilege Escalation|Elevation of Privilege|Information Disclosure|XSS|Cross-Site|SQL Injection|SQLi|Authentication Bypass|Security Bypass|Buffer Overflow|Memory Corruption|Command Injection|Path Traversal|Directory Traversal|SSRF|XXE|Missing Authentication|Missing Authorization|Incorrect Authorization|Improper (?:Authentication|Access Control|Input Validation|Certificate Validation)|Hard-coded|Deserialization|Arbitrary File|Heap-based|Stack-based|NULL Pointer|Null Pointer|Out-of-bounds|Use-after-free|Integer Overflow|Unquoted Search Path|Untrusted Search Path|Open Redirect|CSRF|Spoofing|Code Execution)\b";"Update {produit}";"Install {produit} {cible} (fixed version published by the vendor){ref_avis}.";"Last resort: product followed by a vulnerability type."
